1. Add a file named .env to your folder
2. Copy-Paste -> & fill the information
#---------------------------------------------

# Database connection
#DO NOT CHANGE
DB_HOST=localhost

#Database name
DB_NAME=

#Database username
DB_USER=

#Database password
DB_PASS=             

# Base URL for redirects - both should be the same
$DOMAIN_START=
BASE_URL=

# Bot for messages
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=
#---------------------------------------------
3. Create a telegram bot by searching "BotFather" 
3.1 Type: 
    /start
    /newbot
    {name}
    {username}
    Bot has been created - Open the chat with him
    Copy Token & paste at "TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN"
    in google Type
    https://api.telegram.org/bot<BOT_TOKEN>/getUpdates - Replace <BOT_TOKEN> WITH BOT_TOKEN
    Should see OK
    Send a message to BOT
    Rfresh the URL for the bot token - Should see "ID" after "chat"
    Copy & paste in TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID
4. Place in Crons jobs everything under src/crons